  "description": "C# SDK for the SAP Business One Service Layer, multi-targeted for .NET 8 / .NET 6 / .NET Standard 2.0 (also runs on .NET Framework 4.6.2+). Auth with automatic session renewal, typed CRUD, fluent OData query builder (LINQ and string-based), transactional batch, raw SQL helper with parameter binding, UDF support, document actions (Close, Cancel, …), IAsyncDisposable for auto-logout, a logging hook and CancellationToken on every async method.",
  "id": "NikSBO",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-05-20T09:16:25.463Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "BxtCWCzW7pSTGMZlHoDcd59H2Y2FVKNOZ5uDS8326WXgaj2DBlDxIm1PQ9dq4IdTUGwY6/zsHkDrMHC/ZdTQtQ==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 174788,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/Jaimenik/NIKBO",
  "published": "2026-05-20T09:13:00.77Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.3.0 — Document actions, await using, logging hook, SqlAsync parametrizado.\n\nNuevas features:\n- Acciones de documento: client.CloseAsync<T>(key), client.InvokeActionAsync<T>(key, action), InvokeActionByEndpointAsync para UDOs.\n- B1Client implementa IAsyncDisposable: await using cierra sesión automáticamente.\n- Logging hook B1Options.LogTrace (Action<string>) sin dependencias externas. Loguea cada request, login/logout, re-logins automáticos y fallos.\n- SqlAsync con parámetros (tipo anónimo o IDictionary<string,object>), escape seguro por tipo — cierra la vía de SQL injection.\n\nMejoras:\n- SqlAsync envuelve cleanup en try/finally; no quedan SQLQueries huérfanos en SAP si la query falla.\n- DisposeAsync delega en Logout() para que el cierre se loguee con LogTrace.\n\nSin breaking changes desde 0.2.0. Tests: 32 (antes 21).",
